{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "得知淳于总已经离职  (Learning Chun Yuqiao Has Resigned)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Slipping out to the patio of Wen Simo's book club, Bu Xiaogu nervously asks Xingzi for news of Chun Yuqiao and is shocked to learn he has already resigned from Xingtian. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，公司的事你听说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你指哪件？老大删了一条成片，还是你私自报警？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "本来我跟凯文休假停工，想让老大也休息两天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去公司了，到处都找不到他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他已经离职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么让他离职啊？星天不能没有他呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我倒是想知道，我们没看见的时候，你跟老大发生了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我做了很不对的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在不应该的时候跟他表白，在不适合的场合跟他大吵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "虽然事情就发生在昨天，但我觉得自己像个低级动物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "希望你以后都高级起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不会再这么放纵自己了，没有淳于总就没有星天的今天。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，公司的事你听说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, have you heard about what happened at the company?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你指哪件？老大删了一条成片，还是你私自报警？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which one do you mean, the boss deleting a master cut or you calling the police on your own?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "本来我跟凯文休假停工，想让老大也休息两天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen and I took leave so the boss could rest for a couple of days too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去公司了，到处都找不到他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I went to the office, and I could not find him anywhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他已经离职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has already resigned.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么让他离职啊？星天不能没有他呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why make him resign? Xingtian cannot do without him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我倒是想知道，我们没看见的时候，你跟老大发生了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would rather know what happened between you and the boss while we were away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我做了很不对的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did something terribly wrong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在不应该的时候跟他表白，在不适合的场合跟他大吵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I confessed my feelings at the wrong time and argued loudly with him in the wrong place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "虽然事情就发生在昨天，但我觉得自己像个低级动物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even though it happened only yesterday, I feel like a primitive creature.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "希望你以后都高级起来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope you carry yourself with maturity from now on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我不会再这么放纵自己了，没有淳于总就没有星天的今天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will never indulge my impulses like that again; without Mr Chun Yuqiao, Xingtian would not be where it is today.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，公司的事你听说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你指哪件？老大删了一条成片，还是你私自报警？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "本来我跟凯文休假停工，想让老大也休息两天。",
      "gap": 0.5
